            "description": "Reference-based RNA-Seq data analysis\n\n## Associated Tutorial\n\nThis workflows is part of the tutorial [Reference-based RNA-Seq data analysis](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/transcriptomics/tutorials/ref-based/tutorial.html), available in the [GTN](https://training.galaxyproject.org)\n\n## Features\n\n* Includes [Galaxy Workflow Tests](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/gtn/workflow_run_test.html)\n* Includes a [Galaxy Workflow Report](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/faqs/galaxy/workflows_report_view.html)\n\n## Thanks to...\n\n**Workflow Author(s)**: Bérénice Batut, Mallory Freeberg, Mo Heydarian, Anika Erxleben, Pavankumar Videm, Clemens Blank, Maria Doyle, Nicola Soranzo, Peter van Heusden, Lucille Delisle\n\n**Tutorial Author(s)**: [Bérénice Batut](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/bebatut/), [Mallory Freeberg](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/malloryfreeberg/), [Mo Heydarian](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/moheydarian/), [Anika Erxleben](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/erxleben/), [Pavankumar Videm](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/pavanvidem/), [Clemens Blank](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/blankclemens/), [Maria Doyle](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/mblue9/), [Nicola Soranzo](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/nsoranzo/), [Peter van Heusden](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/pvanheus/), [Lucille Delisle](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/lldelisle/)\n\n**Tutorial Contributor(s)**: [Helena Rasche](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/hexylena/), [Clea Siguret](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/clsiguret/), [Wolfgang Maier](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/wm75/), [Pavankumar Videm](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/pavanvidem/), [Bérénice Batut](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/bebatut/), [Lucille Delisle](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/lldelisle/), [Björn Grüning](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/bgruening/), [Nicola Soranzo](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/nsoranzo/), [Hans-Rudolf Hotz](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/hrhotz/), [Cristóbal Gallardo](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/gallardoalba/), [Saskia Hiltemann](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/shiltemann/), [Graeme Tyson](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/hrukkudyr/), [Maria Doyle](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/mblue9/), [Amirhossein Naghsh Nilchi](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/Nilchia/), [Mehmet Tekman](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/mtekman/), [Anika Erxleben](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/erxleben/), [Simon Bray](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/simonbray/), [Clemens Blank](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/blankclemens/), [Ekaterina Polkh](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/polkhe/), [William Durand](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/willdurand/), [Marius van den Beek](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/mvdbeek/), [Niall Beard](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/njall/), [Martin Čech](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/martenson/), [Armin Dadras](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/dadrasarmin/), [Florian Heyl](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/heylf/)\n\n**Funder(s)**: [de.NBI](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/hall-of-fame/deNBI/)\n\n[![gtn star logo followed by the word workflows](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/assets/branding/gtn-workflows.png)](https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/)",
